        "content": "extends Node2D\n\n# UI label shown on clear.\n@onready var clear_label: Label = $CanvasLayer/ClearLabel\n\nfunc _ready() -\u003e void:\n\t# Connect the goal flag's body_entered signal.\n\t$GoalFlag.connect(\"body_entered\", Callable(self, \"_on_goal_flag_body_entered\"))\n\tclear_label.visible = false\n\nfunc _on_goal_flag_body_entered(body: Node2D) -\u003e void:\n\t# The player should be the only CharacterBody2D that enters the flag area.\n\tif body is CharacterBody2D:\n\t\tclear_label.visible = true\n\t\t# Freeze the player so movement stops on clear.\n\t\tbody.set_physics_process(false)\n",
